function elite60(){var labels=[{name:'SHIELD 60+',tone:'#7dff9b'},{name:'ALPHA 60+',tone:'#58d9ff'},{name:'QUANT 60+',tone:'#d795ff'}],pool=rated().filter(function(x){return x.o.edge>0&&x.score>=74}),pairs=[];for(var i=0;i<pool.length;i++)for(var j=i+1;j<pool.length;j++){var legs=[pool[i],pool[j]],cs=comboStats(legs),prob=cs.prob,margin=(legs[0].o.edge+legs[1].o.edge)/2;if(prob>=.60&&!cs.blocked)pairs.push({legs:legs,prob:prob,margin:margin,rank:legs[0].score+legs[1].score+margin*100})}pairs.sort(function(a,b){return b.rank-a.rank});return'<div class="superior-title"><h2>Bandejas 60+</h2><span>Acierto combinado estimado ≥60% · edge positivo</span></div><div class="combo-grid">'+labels.map(function(c,n){var pick=pairs[n];return'<article class="card combo" style="--tone:'+c.tone+'"><header><h3>'+c.name+'</h3><span class="positive">'+(pick?'APTO 60%+':'EN ESPERA')+'</span></header>'+(pick?pick.legs.map(function(x){return'<div class="combo-leg"><b>'+esc(x.e.home_team)+' vs '+esc(x.e.away_team)+'</b>'+pickInfo(x.o,'Cuota '+x.o.price.toFixed(2)+' · Stake '+(x.score>=86?5:x.score>=80?4:3)+'/5')+'</div>'}).join(''):'<div class="combo-leg"><span>No hay dos selecciones que superen conjuntamente el 60% con margen positivo.</span></div>')+'<div class="combo-summary"><div><small>Cuota</small><b>'+(pick?(pick.legs[0].o.price*pick.legs[1].o.price).toFixed(2):'—')+'</b></div><div><small>Acierto est.</small><b>'+(pick?Math.round(pick.prob*100)+'%':'—')+'</b></div><div><small>Margen</small><b>'+(pick?'+'+(pick.margin*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—')+'</b></div></div></article>'}).join('')+'</div>'}
